        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under dry argon using Schlenk techniques, Erq3·H2O and equimolar Yb(hfac)3(H2O)2 were added to dichloromethane and stirred for 30 min to give a clear solution. After filtration, the concentrated dichloromethane solution was layered with n-hexane to afford yellow crystals of 1.",
